{
  "tema": 7184,
  "slug": "queria-que",
  "titulo": "Querer que + imperfect subjunctive",
  "subtitulo": "Quería que vinieras conmigo.",
  "foto": "t09.jpg",
  "regla": "With querer in the past (quería, quise), the verb after que goes in the imperfect subjunctive: Mis papás querían que estudiara medicina. Different subjects are required; same subject: infinitive.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": "2026-10-10",
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "formula",
          "partes": [
            "quería / quise / había querido",
            "+ que +",
            "imperfect subjunctive"
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "The two subjects must be different. Same subject: **quería estudiar**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "The action can be past or still to come from that point: **quería que me ayudaras** (then, or later)."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: **quería que** + **-ra**, as one rhythm."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "Yo quería que ==vinieras== conmigo de compras.",
              "en": "I wanted you to come shopping with me."
            },
            {
              "es": "Mis papás querían que ==estudiara== biología.",
              "en": "My parents wanted me to study biology."
            },
            {
              "es": "¿Querías que te ==ayudara== con la tarea?",
              "en": "Did you want me to help you with your homework?"
            },
            {
              "es": "No quiso que lo ==acompañáramos==.",
              "en": "He didn't want us to go with him."
            },
            {
              "es": "Quería que ==hubieras visto== la cara que puso.",
              "en": "I wish you'd seen the face he made."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "trampa",
      "titulo": "The trap",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "pares",
          "lista": [
            {
              "filas": [
                {
                  "v": "mal",
                  "t": "Quería que vienes."
                },
